<description>&lt;p&gt;The war has spread to Sudan's power grid, with attacks disrupting electricity nationwide and factories struggling to restart after wartime damage. RSF drone strikes launched from Ethiopian territory have targeted civilians, prompting the UN peacekeeping chief to warn of a new threat. Ethiopia expelled six Sudanese consular staff and closed Sudan's consulate, and Sudan responded by shutting the Ethiopian consulate. The conflict caused 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFBpUkJMUXd2ZnU1ajhQY05SMTh6SUp3TDZ2aERkbU9GUjBoWDJ5RmRsQ2dieFJJWkx0RVY5YmlodTNIWU5RVFVRRA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxNMWFXZE53Y1NVelM1ZmljRDh3R3JGOHVlME1BZzZ1NmVlZHhHRmNCOEdjLVhobEtMYnVVM181QlNwYWhHM3hhNlBMT25vUjVnUTNYNlRSaFNOb2xMeEJpOUg1M1FfZzZoMzVWNTRKbnpEeUY0MkR1d0VKUmw0OHoxa3hwM0tfVlBVTXNSamVkNGtFVnJYZlM5SFNXUjJ1VDI5SFd5OVNSaWZwbzkydmdF?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxNQW1iNndNcXdOam1DRURFeDl2cExCRk43QXZVX3BUUnRBeWFDa2hTS1AzNnkteGFvUEJrRG5rek1nQlpGRkdMTURyOWFNcDFqc0xQLUpER0o3dElzMUxXSFJQMEwxSlE5ODVPVjZtTkFobHN1cUhMYkVlbHF0LXpRNldTdFhvMEN5SzVpYVJrQ1lSQ2hMWm5INkpn?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE12RzNmdnNRNWJmUWpwdk1VN3lmazV3cnZTN29KMENHRUNJZldMQXlwSl9yYUtmaDZDY0llVUJaMEtYRnJFVmU3WVdzdW5JVUtuQS0wZEJFcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
